  "cards": [
    {
      "dot": "cyan",
      "title": "延迟初始化",
      "items": [
        "initialize 只做 ActivityTracker 挂钩与套接字绑定，真正创建 Dumper、分发器发生在首个连接"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "amber",
      "title": "网络拦截",
      "items": [
        "StethoInterceptor 只做事件搬运：requestWillBeSent、responseHeadersReceived、interpretResponseStream",
        "只有 Chrome 打开 Network 面板并注册 peer 后 isEnabled 才为 true，避免常规调试付代价"
      ]
    }
  ]
